<p data-start="49" data-end="128">This is the section that decides whether your project looks average or premium.</p>
<p data-start="130" data-end="173">Not footer.<br>
Not testimonials.<br>
Hero section.</p>
<p data-start="175" data-end="206">Spend most of your effort here.</p>
<hr data-start="208" data-end="211">
<h1 data-section-id="16x2wff" data-start="213" data-end="237">YOUR HERO SECTION GOAL</h1>
<p data-start="239" data-end="295">When someone opens the page, they should instantly feel:</p>
<blockquote data-start="297" data-end="346">
<p data-start="299" data-end="346">“This looks like a real luxury skincare brand.”</p>
</blockquote>
<p data-start="348" data-end="366">That’s the target.</p>
<hr data-start="368" data-end="371">
<h1 data-section-id="y08kwj" data-start="373" data-end="384">STRUCTURE</h1>
<p data-start="386" data-end="405">Use Bootstrap grid.</p>
<p data-start="407" data-end="417">Left side:</p>
<ul data-start="418" data-end="449">
<li data-section-id="hbrqow" data-start="418" data-end="427">
<p data-start="420" data-end="427">heading</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="161lkzq" data-start="428" data-end="439">
<p data-start="430" data-end="439">paragraph</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="13o2i99" data-start="440" data-end="449">
<p data-start="442" data-end="449">buttons</p>
</li>
</ul>
<p data-start="451" data-end="462">Right side:</p>
<ul data-start="463" data-end="484">
<li data-section-id="1romwp5" data-start="463" data-end="484">
<p data-start="465" data-end="484">large premium image</p>
</li>
</ul>
<p data-start="486" data-end="514">Simple layout.<br>
But polished.</p>
<hr data-start="516" data-end="519">
<h1 data-section-id="1wfsnlo" data-start="521" data-end="536">ADD THIS HTML</h1>
<p data-start="538" data-end="571">Inside <code data-start="545" data-end="557">index.html</code> BELOW navbar:</p>
