</span><span class="ͼo">&gt;</span><br><span>                  Explore Collection</span><br><span>               </span><span class="ͼo">&lt;/a&gt;</span><br><br><span>               </span><span class="ͼo">&lt;a</span><span> </span><span class="ͼn">href</span><span class="ͼg">=</span><span class="ͼk">"#"</span><span> </span><span class="ͼn">class</span><span class="ͼg">=</span><span class="ͼk">"btn outline-btn"</span><span class="ͼo">&gt;</span><br><span>                  Learn More</span><br><span>               </span><span class="ͼo">&lt;/a&gt;</span><br><br><span>            </span><span class="ͼo">&lt;/div&gt;</span><br><br><span>         </span><span class="ͼo">&lt;/div&gt;</span><br><br><span>         </span><span class="ͼe">&lt;!-- RIGHT SIDE --&gt;</span><br><br><span>         </span><span class="ͼo">&lt;div</span><span> </span><span class="ͼn">class</span><span class="ͼg">=</span><span class="ͼk">"col-lg-6 text-center"</span><span class="ͼo">&gt;</span><br><br><span>            </span><span class="ͼo">&lt;div</span><span> </span><span class="ͼn">class</span><span class="ͼg">=</span><span class="ͼk">"hero-image"</span><span class="ͼo">&gt;</span><br><br><span>               </span><span class="ͼo">&lt;img</span><span> </span><span class="ͼn">src</span><span class="ͼg">=</span><span class="ͼk">"YOUR-IMAGE-LINK"</span><span> </span><span class="ͼn">class</span><span class="ͼg">=</span><span class="ͼk">"img-fluid"</span><span class="ͼo">&gt;</span><br><br><span>            </span><span class="ͼo">&lt;/div&gt;</span><br><br><span>         </span><span class="ͼo">&lt;/div&gt;</span><br><br><span>      </span><span class="ͼo">&lt;/div&gt;</span><br><br><span>   </span><span class="ͼo">&lt;/div&gt;</span><br><br><span class="ͼo">&lt;/section&gt;</span></code></pre></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class=""><div class="" style="width: 100%; transform: none;"></div></div></div></div></div></pre>
<hr data-start="1546" data-end="1549">
<h1 data-section-id="1moletq" data-start="1551" data-end="1566">NOW THE IMAGE</h1>
<p data-start="1568" data-end="1628">Use ONE strong image.<br>
Not random Pinterest collage nonsense.</p>
<p data-start="1630" data-end="1637">Search:</p>
<ul data-start="1638" data-end="1716">
<li data-section-id="1h8g9oz" data-start="1638" data-end="1663">
<p data-start="1640" data-end="1663">“luxury skincare model”</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="20eilf" data-start="1664" data-end="1691">
<p data-start="1666" data-end="1691">“minimal beauty portrait”</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="3izhp1" data-start="1692" data-end="1716">
<p data-start="1694" data-end="1716">“skincare woman beige”</p>
</li>
</ul>
<p data-start="1718" data-end="1722">Use:</p>
<ul data-start="1723" data-end="1802">
<li data-section-id="15a85x" data-start="1723" data-end="1762">
<p data-start="1725" data-end="1762"><span class="" data-state="closed"><a target="_blank" class="decorated-link" rel="noopener" href="https://unsplash.com/?utm_source=chatgpt.com">Unsplash<span aria-hidden="true" class="ms-0.5 inline-block align-middle leading-none select-none"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" aria-hidden="true" data-rtl-flip="" class="block h-[0.75em] w-[0.75em] stroke-current stroke-[0.75] select-none"><use href="/cdn/assets/sprites-core-27273b9b.svg#304883" fill="currentColor"></use></svg></span></a></span></p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="lyf7sl" data-start="1763" data-end="1802">
<p data-start="1765" data-end="1802"><span class="" data-state="closed"><a target="_blank" class="decorated-link" rel="noopener" href="https://www.pexels.com/?utm_source=chatgpt.com">Pexels<span aria-hidden="true" class="ms-0.5 inline-block align-middle leading-none select-none"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" aria-hidden="true" data-rtl-flip="" class="block h-[0.75em] w-[0.75em] stroke-current stroke-[0.75] select-none"><use href="/cdn/assets/sprites-core-27273b9b.svg#304883" fill="currentColor"></use></svg></span></a></span></p>
</li>
</ul>
<p data-start="1804" data-end="1811">Choose:</p>
<ul data-start="1812" data-end="1860">
<li data-section-id="1jvf9zb" data-start="1812" data-end="1825">
<p data-start="1814" data-end="1825">beige tones</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="1w264d4" data-start="1826" data-end="1841">
<p data-start="1828" data-end="1841">soft lighting</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="wnn1xf" data-start="1842" data-end="1860">
<p data-start="1844" data-end="1860">clean background</p>
</li>
</ul>
<hr data-start="1862" data-end="1865">
<h1 data-section-id="19w0kgj" data-start="1867" data-end="1876">NOW CSS</h1>
<p data-start="1878" data-end="1901">Add this in <code data-start="1890" data-end="1901">style.css</code></p>
<pre class="overflow-visible! px-0!" data-start="1903" data-end="2791"><div class="relative w-full mt-4 mb-1"><div class=""><div class="relative"><div class="h-full min-h-0 min-w-0"><div class="h-full min-h-0 min-w-0" style="width: 100%; transform: none;"><div class="border border-token-border-light border-radius-3xl corner-superellipse/1.1 rounded-3xl"><div class="h-full w-full border-radius-3xl bg-token-bg-elevated-secondary corner-superellipse/1.1 overflow-clip rounded-3xl lxnfua_clipPathFallback"><div class="sticky top-(--sticky-padding-top) z-2 select-none"><div class="flex w-full items-center justify-between py-1.5 ps-4 pe-1.5 font-sans md:ps-5 bg-token-bg-elevated-secondary"><div class="flex max-w-[75%] min-w-0 cursor-default items-center text-sm font-medium justify-self-start text-token-text-primary"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" aria-hidden="true" class="icon-sm me-2.5 shrink-0"><use href="/cdn/assets/sprites-core-27273b9b.svg#e45ab3" fill="currentColor"></use></svg>CSS</div><div class="flex flex-row items-center gap-0.5 justify-self-end"><button type="button" class="flex gap-1 items-center select-none py-2 text-sm font-medium hover:bg-black/5 dark:hover:bg-white/10 size-9 rounded-full px-2" aria-label="Copy" data-state="closed"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" aria-hidden="true" class="icon-md"><use href="/cdn/assets/sprites-core-27273b9b.svg#ce3544" fill="currentColor"></use></svg></button></div></div></div><div class="pointer-events-none absolute inset-x-4 top-12 bottom-4"><div class="pointer-events-none sticky z-40 shrink-0 z-1!" style="top: calc(calc(var(--sticky-padding-top) + 48px) - 1px * 3); margin-bottom: calc(-4px); height: calc(4px); mask-image: linear-gradient(transparent 25%, white 75%);"><div class="sticky bg-token-border-light" style="top: calc(var(--sticky-padding-top) + 48px); height: 1px;"></div></div></div><div class="relative"><div class="" style="transform: none;"><div class="relative z-0 flex max-w-full"><div id="code-block-viewer" dir="ltr" class="q9tKkq_viewer cm-editor z-10 light:cm-light dark:cm-light flex h-full w-full flex-col items-stretch ͼd ͼr"><div class="cm-scroller"><pre class="cm-content q9tKkq_readonly m-0"><code><span class="ͼe">/* HERO SECTION */</span><br><br><span>.</span><span class="ͼl">hero-section</span><span>{</span><br><span>    background:</span><span class="ͼg">linear-gradient</span><span>(</span><span class="ͼj">to</span><span> </span><span class="ͼj">right</span><span>,#F8F1EA,#FFFDFB);</span><br><span>    padding-top:</span><span class="ͼj">120</span><span class="ͼg">px</span><span>;</span><br><span>}</span><br><br><span class="ͼe">/* HERO TEXT */</span><br><br><span>.</span><span class="ͼl">hero-text</span><span> </span><span class="ͼo">h1</span><span>{</span><br><span>    font-size:</span><span class="ͼj">72</span><span class="ͼg">px</span><span>;</span><br><span>    line-height:</span><span class="ͼj">1.2</span><span>;</span><br><span>    font-weight:</span><span class="ͼj">700</span><span>;</span><br><span>    color:#2B2B2B;</span><br><span>    font-family:</span><span class="ͼk">'Playfair Display'</span><span>,</span><span class="ͼj">serif</span><span>;</span><br><span>}</span><br><br><span>.</span><span class="ͼl">hero-text</span><span> </span><span class="ͼo">p</span><span>{</span><br><span>    font-size:</span><span class="ͼj">18</span><span class="ͼg">px</span><span>;</span><br><span>    color:#6B6B6B;</span><br><span>    margin:</span><span class="ͼj">30</span><span class="ͼg">px</span><span> </span><span class="ͼj">0</span><span>;</span><br><span>    line-height:</span><span class="ͼj">1.8</span><span>;</span><br><span>}</span><br><br><span class="ͼe">/* HERO IMAGE */</span><br><br><span>.</span><span class="ͼl">hero-image</span><span> </span><span class="ͼo">img</span><span>{</span><br><span>    width:</span><span class="ͼj">90</span><span class="ͼg">%</span><span>;</span><br><span>    border-radius:</span><span class="ͼj">30</span><span class="ͼg">px</span><span>;</span><br><span>}</span><br><br><span class="ͼe">/* BUTTONS */</span><br><br><span>.</span><span class="ͼl">custom-btn</span><span>{</span><br><span>    background:#7A5C58;</span><br><span>    color:</span><span class="ͼj">white</span><span>;</span><br><span>    padding:</span><span class="ͼj">14</span><span class="ͼg">px</span><span> </span><span class="ͼj">32</span><span class="ͼg">px</span><span>;</span><br><span>    border-radius:</span><span class="ͼj">40</span><span class="ͼg">px</span><span>;</span><br><span>    transition:</span><span class="ͼj">0.4</span><span class="ͼg">s</span><span> </span><span class="ͼj">ease</span><span>;</span><br><span>}</span><br><br><span>.</span><span class="ͼl">custom-btn</span><span>:</span><span class="ͼl">hover</span><span>{</span><br><span>    background:#5f4440;</span><br><span>    transform:</span><span class="ͼg">translateY</span><span>(</span><span class="ͼj">-5</span><span class="ͼg">px</span><span>);</span><br><span>    color:</span><span class="ͼj">white</span><span>;</span><br><span>}</span><br><br><span>.</span><span class="ͼl">outline-btn</span><span>{</span><br><span>    border:</span><span class="ͼj">1</span><span class="ͼg">px</span><span> </span><span class="ͼj">solid</span><span> #7A5C58;</span><br><span>    padding:</span><span class="ͼj">14</span><span class="ͼg">px</span><span> </span><span class="ͼj">32</span><span class="ͼg">px</span><span>;</span><br><span>    border-radius:</span><span class="ͼj">40</span><span class="ͼg">px</span><span>;</span><br><span>    color:#7A5C58;</span><br><span>}</span><br><br><span>.</span><span class="ͼl">outline-btn</span><span>:</span><span class="ͼl">hover</span><span>{</span><br><span>    background:#7A5C58;</span><br><span>    color:</span><span class="ͼj">white</span><span>;</span><br><span>}</span></code></pre></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class=""><div class="" style="width: 100%; transform: none;"></div></div></div></div></div></pre>
<hr data-start="2793" data-end="2796">
<h1 data-section-id="11h2zj4" data-start="2798" data-end="2809">IMPORTANT</h1>
<p data-start="2811" data-end="2818">Do NOT:</p>
<ul data-start="2819" data-end="2893">
<li data-section-id="1g49jv7" data-start="2819" data-end="2838">
<p data-start="2821" data-end="2838">add too much text</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="ronzny" data-start="2839" data-end="2858">
<p data-start="2841" data-end="2858">overcrowd buttons</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="1sltjg0" data-start="2859" data-end="2873">
<p data-start="2861" data-end="2873">use 5 colors</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="1i06vqj" data-start="2874" data-end="2893">
<p data-start="2876" data-end="2893">use giant shadows</p>
</li>
</ul>
<p data-start="2895" data-end="2927">Luxury UI needs breathing space.</p>
<hr data-start="2929" data-end="2932">
<h1 data-section-id="1mlg6tg" data-start="2934" data-end="2946">AFTER THIS</h1>
<p data-start="2948" data-end="2996">Once your hero section looks good:<br>
THEN move to:</p>
<ol data-start="2997" data-end="3048">
<li data-section-id="1bj5r02" data-start="2997" data-end="3017">
<p data-start="3000" data-end="3017">Featured products</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="l71n5p" data-start="3018" data-end="3029">
<p data-start="3021" data-end="3029">Benefits</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="1mw31wv" data-start="3030" data-end="3048">
<p data-start="3033" data-end="3048">Routine section</p>
</li>
</ol>
<p data-start="3050" data-end="3102" data-is-last-node="" data-is-only-node="">Build section by section.<br>
Not whole website at once.</p></div></div></div></div><div class="z-0 flex min-h-[46px] justify-start"><div aria-label="Response actions" class="touch:-me-2 touch:-ms-3.5 -ms-2.5 -me-1 flex flex-wrap items-center gap-y-4 p-1 select-none touch:w-[calc(100%+--spacing(3.5))] -mt-1 w-[calc(100%+--spacing(2.5))] duration-[1.5s] focus-within:transition-none hover:transition-none touch:pointer-events-auto pointer-events-none [mask-image:linear-gradient(to_right,black_33%,transparent_66%)] [mask-size:300%_100%] [mask-position:100%_0%] motion-safe:transition-[mask-position] group-hover/turn-messages:pointer-events-auto group-hover/turn-messages:[mask-position:0_0] group-focus-within/turn-messages:pointer-events-auto group-focus-within/turn-messages:[mask-position:0_0] has-data-[state=open]:pointer-events-auto has-data-[state=open]:[mask-position:0_0]" role="group" tabindex="-1" style="mask-position: 0% 0%;"><button class="text-token-text-secondary hover:bg-token-bg-secondary rounded-lg" aria-label="Copy response" data-testid="copy-turn-action-button" data-state="closed"><span class="flex items-center justify-center touch:w-10 h-8 w-8"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" aria-hidden="true" class="icon"><use href="/cdn/assets/sprites-core-27273b9b.svg#ce3544" fill="currentColor"></use></svg></span></button><button class="text-token-text-secondary hover:bg-token-bg-secondary rounded-lg" aria-label="Good response" aria-pressed="false" data-testid="good-response-turn-action-button" data-state="closed"><span class="flex items-center justify-center touch:w-10 h-8 w-8"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" aria-hidden="true" class="icon"><use href="/cdn/assets/sprites-core-27273b9b.svg#51753c" fill="currentColor"></use></svg></span></button><button class="text-token-text-secondary hover:bg-token-bg-secondary rounded-lg" aria-label="Bad response" aria-pressed="false" data-testid="bad-response-turn-action-button" data-state="closed">