s="relative z-0 flex max-w-full"><div id="code-block-viewer" dir="ltr" class="q9tKkq_viewer cm-editor z-10 light:cm-light dark:cm-light flex h-full w-full flex-col items-stretch ͼd ͼr"><div class="cm-scroller"><pre class="cm-content q9tKkq_readonly m-0"><code><span class="ͼe">/* PRODUCTS SECTION */</span><br><br><span>.</span><span class="ͼl">products-section</span><span>{</span><br><span>    padding:</span><span class="ͼj">100</span><span class="ͼg">px</span><span> </span><span class="ͼj">0</span><span>;</span><br><span>    background:#FFFDFB;</span><br><span>}</span><br><br><span class="ͼe">/* SECTION TITLE */</span><br><br><span>.</span><span class="ͼl">section-title</span><span>{</span><br><span>    font-size:</span><span class="ͼj">52</span><span class="ͼg">px</span><span>;</span><br><span>    color:#2B2B2B;</span><br><span>    font-family:</span><span class="ͼk">'Playfair Display'</span><span>,</span><span class="ͼj">serif</span><span>;</span><br><span>}</span><br><br><span>.</span><span class="ͼl">section-subtitle</span><span>{</span><br><span>    color:#6B6B6B;</span><br><span>    margin-top:</span><span class="ͼj">15</span><span class="ͼg">px</span><span>;</span><br><span>}</span><br><br><span class="ͼe">/* PRODUCT CARD */</span><br><br><span>.</span><span class="ͼl">product-card</span><span>{</span><br><span>    background:</span><span class="ͼj">white</span><span>;</span><br><span>    border-radius:</span><span class="ͼj">30</span><span class="ͼg">px</span><span>;</span><br><span>    overflow:</span><span class="ͼj">hidden</span><span>;</span><br><span>    transition:</span><span class="ͼj">0.4</span><span class="ͼg">s</span><span> </span><span class="ͼj">ease</span><span>;</span><br><span>    box-shadow:</span><span class="ͼj">0</span><span> </span><span class="ͼj">10</span><span class="ͼg">px</span><span> </span><span class="ͼj">30</span><span class="ͼg">px</span><span> </span><span class="ͼg">rgba</span><span>(</span><span class="ͼj">0</span><span>,</span><span class="ͼj">0</span><span>,</span><span class="ͼj">0</span><span>,</span><span class="ͼj">0.08</span><span>);</span><br><span>}</span><br><br><span>.</span><span class="ͼl">product-card</span><span>:</span><span class="ͼl">hover</span><span>{</span><br><span>    transform:</span><span class="ͼg">translateY</span><span>(</span><span class="ͼj">-10</span><span class="ͼg">px</span><span>);</span><br><span>}</span><br><br><span class="ͼe">/* PRODUCT IMAGE */</span><br><br><span>.</span><span class="ͼl">product-card</span><span> </span><span class="ͼo">img</span><span>{</span><br><span>    width:</span><span class="ͼj">100</span><span class="ͼg">%</span><span>;</span><br><span>    height:</span><span class="ͼj">350</span><span class="ͼg">px</span><span>;</span><br><span>    object-fit:</span><span class="ͼj">cover</span><span>;</span><br><span>}</span><br><br><span class="ͼe">/* CONTENT */</span><br><br><span>.</span><span class="ͼl">product-content</span><span>{</span><br><span>    padding:</span><span class="ͼj">30</span><span class="ͼg">px</span><span>;</span><br><span>}</span><br><br><span>.</span><span class="ͼl">product-content</span><span> </span><span class="ͼo">h4</span><span>{</span><br><span>    font-size:</span><span class="ͼj">28</span><span class="ͼg">px</span><span>;</span><br><span>    margin-bottom:</span><span class="ͼj">15</span><span class="ͼg">px</span><span>;</span><br><span>    color:#2B2B2B;</span><br><span>}</span><br><br><span>.</span><span class="ͼl">product-content</span><span> </span><span class="ͼo">p</span><span>{</span><br><span>    color:#6B6B6B;</span><br><span>    line-height:</span><span class="ͼj">1.7</span><span>;</span><br><span>}</span><br><br><span>.</span><span class="ͼl">product-content</span><span> </span><span class="ͼo">h5</span><span>{</span><br><span>    margin-top:</span><span class="ͼj">20</span><span class="ͼg">px</span><span>;</span><br><span>    color:#7A5C58;</span><br><span>    font-weight:</span><span class="ͼj">600</span><span>;</span><br><span>}</span></code></pre></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class=""><div class="" style="width: 100%; transform: none;"></div></div></div></div></div></pre>
<hr data-start="3290" data-end="3293">
<h1 data-section-id="13pht5i" data-start="3295" data-end="3308">IMAGE STYLE</h1>
<p data-start="3310" data-end="3320">IMPORTANT.</p>
<p data-start="3322" data-end="3346">Use product images with:</p>
<ul data-start="3347" data-end="3419">
<li data-section-id="8zwcay" data-start="3347" data-end="3365">
<p data-start="3349" data-end="3365">beige background</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="fzus37" data-start="3366" data-end="3380">
<p data-start="3368" data-end="3380">soft shadows</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="6l7uhg" data-start="3381" data-end="3400">
<p data-start="3383" data-end="3400">minimal packaging</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="smc9vr" data-start="3401" data-end="3419">
<p data-start="3403" data-end="3419">luxury aesthetic</p>
</li>
</ul>
<p data-start="3421" data-end="3428">Search:</p>
<ul data-start="3429" data-end="3512">
<li data-section-id="trwa0o" data-start="3429" data-end="3459">
<p data-start="3431" data-end="3459">“skincare product aesthetic”</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="dnw9iq" data-start="3460" data-end="3484">
<p data-start="3462" data-end="3484">“serum bottle minimal”</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="oq9chg" data-start="3485" data-end="3512">
<p data-start="3487" data-end="3512">“luxury cosmetic product”</p>
</li>
</ul>
<p data-start="3514" data-end="3520">Avoid:</p>
<ul data-start="3521" data-end="3594">
<li data-section-id="1ewcuez" data-start="3521" data-end="3542">
<p data-start="3523" data-end="3542">colorful makeup ads</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="1mrxg1n" data-start="3543" data-end="3561">
<p data-start="3545" data-end="3561">cluttered photos</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="1a2msdv" data-start="3562" data-end="3594">
<p data-start="3564" data-end="3594">random ecommerce product shots</p>
</li>
</ul>
<hr data-start="3596" data-end="3599">
<h1 data-section-id="16dushw" data-start="3601" data-end="3629">VERY IMPORTANT DESIGN RULE</h1>
<p data-start="3631" data-end="3636">Keep:</p>
<ul data-start="3637" data-end="3698">
<li data-section-id="11u06tm" data-start="3637" data-end="3656">
<p data-start="3639" data-end="3656">same image height</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="j71mfb" data-start="3657" data-end="3676">
<p data-start="3659" data-end="3676">same card spacing</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="13bc0xm" data-start="3677" data-end="3698">
<p data-start="3679" data-end="3698">same text structure</p>
</li>
</ul>
<p data-start="3700" data-end="3733">Consistency creates premium feel.</p>
<p data-start="3735" data-end="3780">Messy alignment destroys luxury UI instantly.</p>
<hr data-start="3782" data-end="3785">
<h1 data-section-id="r1nwod" data-start="3787" data-end="3807">AFTER THIS SECTION</h1>
<p data-start="3809" data-end="3869">Next you should build:<br>
👉 “Why Choose Us” / Benefits section</p>
