ontent-margin)"><div class="[--thread-content-max-width:40rem] @w-lg/main:[--thread-content-max-width:48rem] mx-auto max-w-(--thread-content-max-width) flex-1 group/turn-messages focus-visible:outline-hidden relative flex w-full min-w-0 flex-col agent-turn"><div class="flex max-w-full flex-col gap-4 grow"><div data-message-author-role="assistant" data-message-id="54cc9d2d-e5b3-43f4-ac65-fd72780148f0" dir="auto" data-message-model-slug="gpt-5-5" class="min-h-8 text-message relative flex w-full flex-col items-end gap-2 text-start break-words whitespace-normal outline-none keyboard-focused:focus-ring [.text-message+&amp;]:mt-1"><div class="flex w-full flex-col gap-1 empty:hidden"><div class="markdown prose dark:prose-invert wrap-break-word w-full light markdown-new-styling"><p data-start="0" data-end="57">Good. Now build the <strong data-start="20" data-end="48">Why Choose Us / Benefits</strong> section.</p>
<p data-start="59" data-end="101">This section is IMPORTANT psychologically.</p>
<p data-start="103" data-end="107">Why?</p>
<p data-start="109" data-end="153">Because now your website stops looking like:</p>
<blockquote data-start="154" data-end="181">
<p data-start="156" data-end="181">“Here are some products.”</p>
</blockquote>
<p data-start="183" data-end="207">And starts looking like:</p>
<blockquote data-start="208" data-end="250">
<p data-start="210" data-end="250">“This is a real premium skincare brand.”</p>
</blockquote>
<p data-start="252" data-end="271">That shift matters.</p>
<hr data-start="273" data-end="276">
<h1 data-section-id="2s12p1" data-start="278" data-end="300">GOAL OF THIS SECTION</h1>
<p data-start="302" data-end="309">Create:</p>
<ul data-start="310" data-end="346">
<li data-section-id="16mfzss" data-start="310" data-end="317">
<p data-start="312" data-end="317">trust</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="ky55re" data-start="318" data-end="328">
<p data-start="320" data-end="328">elegance</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="oo7kc4" data-start="329" data-end="346">
<p data-start="331" data-end="346">professionalism</p>
</li>
</ul>
<p data-start="348" data-end="406">This section should feel:<br>
clean + informative + luxurious.</p>
<hr data-start="408" data-end="411">
<h1 data-section-id="1cdt8uw" data-start="413" data-end="428">SECTION STYLE</h1>
<p data-start="430" data-end="434">Use:</p>
<ul data-start="435" data-end="509">
<li data-section-id="68c9o2" data-start="435" data-end="457">
<p data-start="437" data-end="457">soft nude background</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="1h7bc00" data-start="458" data-end="473">
<p data-start="460" data-end="473">elegant icons</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="1xm55fc" data-start="474" data-end="491">
<p data-start="476" data-end="491">centered layout</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="qs67wk" data-start="492" data-end="509">
<p data-start="494" data-end="509">lots of spacing</p>
</li>
</ul>
<p data-start="511" data-end="532">NOT giant paragraphs.</p>
<p data-start="534" data-end="566">Luxury brands keep text minimal.</p>
<hr data-start="568" data-end="571">
