<h1 data-section-id="19w0kgj" data-start="2654" data-end="2663">NOW CSS</h1>
<p data-start="2665" data-end="2688">Add this in <code data-start="2677" data-end="2688">style.css</code></p>
<pre class="overflow-visible! px-0!" data-start="2690" data-end="3249"><div class="relative w-full mt-4 mb-1"><div class=""><div class="relative"><div class="h-full min-h-0 min-w-0"><div class="h-full min-h-0 min-w-0" style="width: 100%; transform: none;"><div class="border border-token-border-light border-radius-3xl corner-superellipse/1.1 rounded-3xl"><div class="h-full w-full border-radius-3xl bg-token-bg-elevated-secondary corner-superellipse/1.1 overflow-clip rounded-3xl lxnfua_clipPathFallback"><div class="sticky top-(--sticky-padding-top) z-2 select-none"><div class="flex w-full items-center justify-between py-1.5 ps-4 pe-1.5 font-sans md:ps-5 bg-token-bg-elevated-secondary"><div class="flex max-w-[75%] min-w-0 cursor-default items-center text-sm font-medium justify-self-start text-token-text-primary"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" aria-hidden="true" class="icon-sm me-2.5 shrink-0"><use href="/cdn/assets/sprites-core-27273b9b.svg#e45ab3" fill="currentColor"></use></svg>CSS</div><div class="flex flex-row items-center gap-0.5 justify-self-end"><button type="button" class="flex gap-1 items-center select-none py-2 text-sm font-medium hover:bg-black/5 dark:hover:bg-white/10 size-9 rounded-full px-2" aria-label="Copy" data-state="closed"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" aria-hidden="true" class="icon-md"><use href="/cdn/assets/sprites-core-27273b9b.svg#ce3544" fill="currentColor"></use></svg></button></div></div></div><div class="pointer-events-none absolute inset-x-4 top-12 bottom-4"><div class="pointer-events-none sticky z-40 shrink-0 z-1!" style="top: calc(calc(var(--sticky-padding-top) + 48px) - 1px * 3); margin-bottom: calc(-4px); height: calc(4px); mask-image: linear-gradient(transparent 25%, white 75%);"><div class="sticky bg-token-border-light" style="top: calc(var(--sticky-padding-top) + 48px); height: 1px;"></div></div></div><div class="relative"><div class="" style="transform: none;"><div class="relative z-0 flex max-w-full"><div id="code-block-viewer" dir="ltr" class="q9tKkq_viewer cm-editor z-10 light:cm-light dark:cm-light flex h-full w-full flex-col items-stretch ͼd ͼr"><div class="cm-scroller"><pre class="cm-content q9tKkq_readonly m-0"><code><span class="ͼe">/* BENEFITS SECTION */</span><br><br><span>.</span><span class="ͼl">benefits-section</span><span>{</span><br><span>    padding:</span><span class="ͼj">100</span><span class="ͼg">px</span><span> </span><span class="ͼj">0</span><span>;</span><br><span>    background:#E7D3C5;</span><br><span>}</span><br><br><span class="ͼe">/* BENEFIT BOX */</span><br><br><span>.</span><span class="ͼl">benefit-box</span><span>{</span><br><span>    background:#FFFDFB;</span><br><span>    padding:</span><span class="ͼj">40</span><span class="ͼg">px</span><span> </span><span class="ͼj">30</span><span class="ͼg">px</span><span>;</span><br><span>    border-radius:</span><span class="ͼj">30</span><span class="ͼg">px</span><span>;</span><br><span>    transition:</span><span class="ͼj">0.4</span><span class="ͼg">s</span><span> </span><span class="ͼj">ease</span><span>;</span><br><span>    height:</span><span class="ͼj">100</span><span class="ͼg">%</span><span>;</span><br><span>}</span><br><br><span>.</span><span class="ͼl">benefit-box</span><span>:</span><span class="ͼl">hover</span><span>{</span><br><span>    transform:</span><span class="ͼg">translateY</span><span>(</span><span class="ͼj">-10</span><span class="ͼg">px</span><span>);</span><br><span>}</span><br><br><span class="ͼe">/* ICON */</span><br><br><span>.</span><span class="ͼl">benefit-icon</span><span>{</span><br><span>    font-size:</span><span class="ͼj">45</span><span class="ͼg">px</span><span>;</span><br><span>    margin-bottom:</span><span class="ͼj">25</span><span class="ͼg">px</span><span>;</span><br><span>}</span><br><br><span class="ͼe">/* TITLE */</span><br><br><span>.</span><span class="ͼl">benefit-box</span><span> </span><span class="ͼo">h4</span><span>{</span><br><span>    font-size:</span><span class="ͼj">26</span><span class="ͼg">px</span><span>;</span><br><span>    margin-bottom:</span><span class="ͼj">15</span><span class="ͼg">px</span><span>;</span><br><span>    color:#2B2B2B;</span><br><span>}</span><br><br><span class="ͼe">/* TEXT */</span><br><br><span>.</span><span class="ͼl">benefit-box</span><span> </span><span class="ͼo">p</span><span>{</span><br><span>    color:#6B6B6B;</span><br><span>    line-height:</span><span class="ͼj">1.8</span><span>;</span><br><span>}</span></code></pre></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class=""><div class="" style="width: 100%; transform: none;"></div></div></div></div></div></pre>
<hr data-start="3251" data-end="3254">
<h1 data-section-id="icnewt" data-start="3256" data-end="3280">WHY THIS SECTION WORKS</h1>
<p data-start="3282" data-end="3298">Because it adds:</p>
<ul data-start="3299" data-end="3366">
<li data-section-id="1enxx3u" data-start="3299" data-end="3315">
<p data-start="3301" data-end="3315">visual balance</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="16mfzss" data-start="3316" data-end="3323">
<p data-start="3318" data-end="3323">trust</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="1f8h2sa" data-start="3324" data-end="3349">
<p data-start="3326" data-end="3349">softer section contrast</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="16opblx" data-start="3350" data-end="3366">
<p data-start="3352" data-end="3366">brand identity</p>
</li>
</ul>
<p data-start="3368" data-end="3419">Without this section your website feels incomplete.</p>
