<p data-start="71" data-end="105">The <strong data-start="75" data-end="104">Skincare Routine Timeline</strong>.</p>
<p data-start="107" data-end="125">This section adds:</p>
<ul data-start="126" data-end="194">
<li data-section-id="yjnrp6" data-start="126" data-end="140">
<p data-start="128" data-end="140">storytelling</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="habl7x" data-start="141" data-end="159">
<p data-start="143" data-end="159">brand experience</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="1x5qh4p" data-start="160" data-end="174">
<p data-start="162" data-end="174">premium feel</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="15ifv44" data-start="175" data-end="194">
<p data-start="177" data-end="194">visual uniqueness</p>
</li>
</ul>
<p data-start="196" data-end="264">Most students won’t build sections like this.<br>
That’s why it matters.</p>
<hr data-start="266" data-end="269">
<h1 data-section-id="2s12p1" data-start="271" data-end="293">GOAL OF THIS SECTION</h1>
<p data-start="295" data-end="311">Make users feel:</p>
<blockquote data-start="312" data-end="348">
<p data-start="314" data-end="348">“This brand understands skincare.”</p>
</blockquote>
<p data-start="350" data-end="376">Not just selling products.</p>
<hr data-start="378" data-end="381">
<h1 data-section-id="1m6ymx7" data-start="383" data-end="397">LAYOUT STYLE</h1>
<p data-start="399" data-end="416">Horizontal steps:</p>
<ul data-start="417" data-end="452">
<li data-section-id="65ycln" data-start="417" data-end="425">
<p data-start="419" data-end="425">Step 1</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="65yclk" data-start="426" data-end="434">
<p data-start="428" data-end="434">Step 2</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="65ycll" data-start="435" data-end="443">
<p data-start="437" data-end="443">Step 3</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="65yclq" data-start="444" data-end="452">
<p data-start="446" data-end="452">Step 4</p>
</li>
</ul>
<p data-start="454" data-end="464">Each step:</p>
<ul data-start="465" data-end="501">
<li data-section-id="19tp04r" data-start="465" data-end="473">
<p data-start="467" data-end="473">number</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="16mm694" data-start="474" data-end="481">
<p data-start="476" data-end="481">title</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="rucm9d" data-start="482" data-end="501">
<p data-start="484" data-end="501">small description</p>
</li>
</ul>
<p data-start="503" data-end="529">Keep it clean and elegant.</p>
<hr data-start="531" data-end="534">
