n><span class="ͼl">step-number</span><span>{</span><br><span>    width:</span><span class="ͼj">80</span><span class="ͼg">px</span><span>;</span><br><span>    height:</span><span class="ͼj">80</span><span class="ͼg">px</span><span>;</span><br><span>    margin:</span><span class="ͼj">auto</span><span>;</span><br><span>    margin-bottom:</span><span class="ͼj">25</span><span class="ͼg">px</span><span>;</span><br><span>    border-radius:</span><span class="ͼj">50</span><span class="ͼg">%</span><span>;</span><br><span>    background:#7A5C58;</span><br><span>    color:</span><span class="ͼj">white</span><span>;</span><br><span>    display:</span><span class="ͼj">flex</span><span>;</span><br><span>    align-items:</span><span class="ͼj">center</span><span>;</span><br><span>    justify-content:</span><span class="ͼj">center</span><span>;</span><br><span>    font-size:</span><span class="ͼj">28</span><span class="ͼg">px</span><span>;</span><br><span>    font-weight:</span><span class="ͼj">600</span><span>;</span><br><span>}</span><br><br><span class="ͼe">/* TITLE */</span><br><br><span>.</span><span class="ͼl">routine-box</span><span> </span><span class="ͼo">h4</span><span>{</span><br><span>    font-size:</span><span class="ͼj">28</span><span class="ͼg">px</span><span>;</span><br><span>    margin-bottom:</span><span class="ͼj">15</span><span class="ͼg">px</span><span>;</span><br><span>    color:#2B2B2B;</span><br><span>}</span><br><br><span class="ͼe">/* TEXT */</span><br><br><span>.</span><span class="ͼl">routine-box</span><span> </span><span class="ͼo">p</span><span>{</span><br><span>    color:#6B6B6B;</span><br><span>    line-height:</span><span class="ͼj">1.8</span><span>;</span><br><span>}</span></code></pre></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class=""><div class="" style="width: 100%; transform: none;"></div></div></div></div></div></pre>
<hr data-start="3445" data-end="3448">
<h1 data-section-id="sfg3wm" data-start="3450" data-end="3478">WHY THIS SECTION IS STRONG</h1>
<p data-start="3480" data-end="3491">Because it:</p>
<ul data-start="3492" data-end="3588">
<li data-section-id="15y41t3" data-start="3492" data-end="3511">
<p data-start="3494" data-end="3511">breaks repetition</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="7ercbz" data-start="3512" data-end="3528">
<p data-start="3514" data-end="3528">adds structure</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="c8cfkh" data-start="3529" data-end="3564">
<p data-start="3531" data-end="3564">feels like real skincare branding</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="gmkkzd" data-start="3565" data-end="3588">
<p data-start="3567" data-end="3588">creates visual rhythm</p>
</li>
</ul>
<p data-start="3590" data-end="3628">That’s how premium landing pages work.</p>
<p data-start="3630" data-end="3672">Not by stuffing random content everywhere.</p>
<hr data-start="3674" data-end="3677">
<h1 data-section-id="11h2zj4" data-start="3679" data-end="3690">IMPORTANT</h1>
<p data-start="3692" data-end="3699">Do NOT:</p>
<ul data-start="3700" data-end="3755">
<li data-section-id="1g49jv7" data-start="3700" data-end="3719">
<p data-start="3702" data-end="3719">add too much text</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="e5glpi" data-start="3720" data-end="3737">
<p data-start="3722" data-end="3737">use giant icons</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="c6xcdm" data-start="3738" data-end="3755">
<p data-start="3740" data-end="3755">overcrowd steps</p>
</li>
</ul>
<p data-start="3757" data-end="3793">Luxury design needs breathing space.</p>
<hr data-start="3795" data-end="3798">
<h1 data-section-id="1avs64o" data-start="3800" data-end="3814">NEXT SECTION</h1>
<p data-start="3816" data-end="3878">Now you should build:<br>
